  "raw_ingress": "design_json must be an inner JSON string parsed only by C1 before any Value/DesignDoc conversion. At command admission cap32MiB on the serialized decoded outer envelope, plus16MiB inner text. This does not prevent allocation in Tauri transport before command admission; no raw outer duplicate-key guarantee is claimed. Inner design_json duplicate guard remains exact. Do not count nested text as outer JSON depth. No arbitrary root/digest/approval fields."
